# The llama.cpp helper that powers on-device text generation: 34 MB of built
# binary that would live in git history forever, and grow by as much on every
# llama.cpp bump. Reproduce it with tools/build-llama-server.sh, which pins the
# upstream commit; build.sh refuses to build without it and prints that command.
Resources/llama-server
