# Backup of the Sparkle EdDSA key lives in ~/.config/dictate/ (outside iCloud);
# the pattern stays as a belt-and-suspenders guard against a stray copy.
sparkle-private-key.pem
Dictate.zip
RESUME-SESSION.md
# PyCharm MCP bridge config — the port is ephemeral, changes every IDE session
.mcp.json
